    <http://example.org/node/chunk1> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "Public Tender - Centre Hospitalier Régional de Belval (CHRB) Implementation of an AI assistance solution for hospital staff 1." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message0> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk10> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "The solution must let staff quickly access reliable, up-to-date information drawn from the authority's internal procedures, care protocols and HAS recommendations, applicable regulatory texts, and internal documents (guides, notes, reference frameworks, drug references)." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message0> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk100> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "Each phase will end with a formal review and a go/no-go decision." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message3> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk101> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "Given The client requirement for a pilot phase on a limited perimeter followed by progressive generalization, our company's can adapt our company's phase-gate structure to accommodate this approach. a pilot phase on a limited perimeter (one or two departments) will focus on one or two departments, allowing our company's to test and refine our company's solution before scaling up to all services. our company's past experience in managing public sector projects, such as the regional council and mutual health insurer projects, has equipped our company's with the necessary expertise to navigate the complexities of public procurement and deliver results within budget constraints. our company's will allocate a dedicated team, including a project director, solution architect, engineers, data scientist, and security compliance lead, to ensure that all aspects of The project's are properly managed." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message3> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk102> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "To meet the client's expectations and budget constraints, our company's will work closely with The client to define clear objectives, scope, and timelines for each phase. our company's agile approach, using two-week sprints with demonstrable increments, will enable our company's to be flexible and responsive to changing requirements while maintaining a focus on delivering value to the client." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message3> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk103> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "By leveraging our company's expertise in project management, our company's understanding of the public sector, and our company's ability to adapt to the client's specific needs, our company's are confident that our company's can successfully coordinate The project's and meet The client expectations within the allocated budget of 900,000 euros over 5 years." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message3> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk104> a prov:Entity ;
